(CHAPTER 1: REFUND POLICY) '
() '
(Section 1.1 \(POL-01-001\) - Refund Policy. Under policy POL-01-001, requests related to) '
(refund policy must be processed within 9 business days. Cases above $148 require written) '
(approval from the Toronto regional office. The responsible team reviews each case,) '
(records the outcome in the central system, and notifies the customer. Exceptions are) '
(granted only by a supervisor, and every exception is logged for the quarterly audit.) '
(Staff should consult the escalation matrix when a request cannot be resolved at the) '
(first level of support.) '
() '
